nd steel production involves  burning coal now that carbon footprint  is paid off with clean energy within  three to six months yet one of the  demands of some climate protesters is to  ban coal mining altogether you see the  problem  it's about the clash of the idealistic  and the realistic in reality things are  moving though ugly not quick enough in  the real world  eliminating emissions doesn't mean you  need to turn the clock back and forget  about growth but if you really want to  go green it helps not to see the world  in black and white at Conway Sky News

